{"id": 10095837, "reference": "SR/03241/25", "publication_date": "2025-09-10T10:23:16.170Z", "modification_date": "2025-09-23T14:01:26.116Z", "country": "Sweden", "product_category": "CHILDCARE_ARTICLES", "product_name": "Cradle", "product_name_specific": "Linda Wiege", "risk_description": "The cradle exceeds the maximum permissible tilt angle/sideway angle. If a child rolls over, it can be unable to return to a supine position and its nose and mouth can be obstructed, causing  suffocation. If the pressure is on its chest, there is also a risk of  asphyxiation. \nMoreover, the distance between the crib and the frame is too small, which could lead to the child having a finger entrapped between them. Additionally, the wheels can easily unlock, which could lead to unintended move of the crib, which could cause that the child has its limbs entrapped in it. ", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with the General Product Safety Regulation nor with the European standard EN 1130.", "country_of_origin": "Unknown", "sold_online": "YES", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["My Baby Lou"], "model_types": ["88130052-01"], "risk_types": ["ASPHYXIATION", "ENTRAPMENT", "SUFFOCATION"], "measures": ["PRODUCT_RECALL_FROM_CONSUMERS"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10975518, "main": true, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10975516, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10975517, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10975519, "main": false, "embedding": ""}]}